          <div class="grid grid-4 olympiad-links">
            <a class="card olympiad-link" href="https://olympiads.bc-pf.org/astronomy" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>🔭</span><strong>Астрономия</strong><small>Задания и решения <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i></small></a>
            <a class="card olympiad-link" href="https://olympiads.bc-pf.org/biology" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>🧬</span><strong>Биология</strong><small>Задания и решения <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i></small></a>
            <a class="card olympiad-link" href="https://olympiads.bc-pf.org/geography" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>🌍</span><strong>География</strong><small>Задания и решения <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i></small></a>
            <a class="card olympiad-link" href="https://olympiads.bc-pf.org/informatics" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>💻</span><strong>Информатика</strong><small>Задания и решения <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i></small></a>
            <a class="card olympiad-link" href="https://olympiads.bc-pf.org/linguistics" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>🔤</span><strong>Лингвистика</strong><small>Задания и решения <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i></small></a>
            <a class="card olympiad-link" href="https://olympiads.bc-pf.org/math" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>∑</span><strong>Математика</strong><small>Задания и решения <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i></small></a>
            <a class="card olympiad-link" href="https://olympiads.bc-pf.org/physics" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>⚛</span><strong>Физика</strong><small>Задания и решения <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i></small></a>
