          <div class="prep-list"><a href="https://olympiads.bc-pf.org/plans/biology" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Биология</a><a href="https://olympiads.bc-pf.org/plans/geography" target="_blank" rel="noopener">География</a><a href="https://olympiads.bc-pf.org/plans/informatics" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Информатика</a><a href="https://olympiads.bc-pf.org/plans/math" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Математика</a><a href="https://olympiads.bc-pf.org/plans/physics" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Физика</a><a href="https://olympiads.bc-pf.org/plans/chemistry" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Химия</a></div>
